  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral Fund for Development in Transition Chile - European Union</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the bilateral fund will be &#xbf;to support a reinforced bilateral dialogue between Chile and the EU on new paths of bilateral cooperation for development, under the Agenda of Development in Transition&#xbf;, jointly implemented with Agencia Chilena de Cooperacion Internacional para el Desarrollo (AGCID). The main objective places its focus on the dialogue, not specific projects. Pilot projects will help to explore innovative alternatives for implementing the agenda defined jointly&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
